<title>THAILAND: Precious Shipping pays 3-baht, 1996 div.</title>
<headline>Precious Shipping pays 3-baht, 1996 div.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>    Div (baht)	  3.00    vs    4.50</p>
<p>    Ex-dividend	 April 11, 1997</p>
<p>    Payment date	April 28, 1997</p>
<p>Note: Company's full name is Precious Shipping Plc, a shipping firm.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662-2529950)</p>
</text>
